<title>USA: Becker appointed Orion Capital chairman, CEO. [CORRECTED 16:50 GMT 1/1]</title>
<headline>Becker appointed Orion Capital chairman, CEO. [CORRECTED 16:50 GMT 1/1]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orion Capital Corp said Tuesday that its board has appointed W. Marston Becker as its chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>Orion had announced in May that it planned to name Becker, 44, as the successor to Chairman and Chief Executive Alan Gruber. The company said Tuesday that Gruber, 69, (Corrects age) remains chairman of the executive and investment committees.</p>
</text>
